<description>&lt;p&gt;Ecuadorian fishermen are filing a lawsuit over an alleged drone strike at sea, claiming they were attacked. Journalist Tomás Beltrán was murdered outside his home and two local election candidates were shot dead in El Oro, while a priest died when a crucifix fell during mass, showing attacks on public figures. The violence is linked to criminal organizations with drug-trafficking connections that have been active since 2018 and is reflected in a November 2026 risk report on campaign violence. The UCDP recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPQVM2SEVWUXlCWC1sdTJqWlJ5Tm8wTUVmYW12UHRHZF81eGtTZ25sWWVoYXRZNVIxOWt3QVFjdmU4WndCblZKUE1Nd3h6U09aUWRMOExaQ25pMjU5OFFVMFZRYUJWMk1TMk0xMWI2LUpWcVZ3TUpwNlc3TExkR3dJSUUwOFBvRDliV3pRNWEzd0dLQUlSQmVoVVZ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOUlY2b3JyZlNXQkttOUNVVWpqNVpBMTZsSzFMLUVGaTZiMElsc2g3R0JybHp2T2xvSGgyQnhkYVRkTy1GUUZEUU9JRlpsZlAyQnJwZTVtdWd5MTJ5bFJCSTdjdFRxNVM1aFJKUjB5WHVabFBfT2FuX3lrY3psbk81TW1YNGhCYTBzRnY2SWFaLTNQdUtEUmdBS09ENGEyVmxaVjE2T0c0M0g0b1NLSU9sWEJ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPeE1IS1FxVUQ1TlJpSVVOY2ZYbHNOWEdxTXkwQU1tZUlIVUZVRU9CUjdPMUNPRTF2NnlQY0dFWEd4UFA1QTNKTGU4RktYNHUxVjRld1dVWDZpbXd0UkdBRHRnY1RKc2NJVTRuU2Y1V1E4YXVMZ0p0T1ByTHhqSlRBNTlHa2U0SGR6Z25vZzFLTXB5VHl5ZF9iNkkyTGdDc204Q0NyU0RSZ3B0LVRhdU5nZA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxORVNqdXJscndBRG9zcG9qeUdQc2d2RW9qYkVsVzA4NGIxZjdlODhzUE4yaTBnY1ZnMmJwaGlVYXpRRnZIYzlFaVhWZkVaWDFxT1k2dVdSN0dwcFZvcWdVRFBBbzR0WWVNRTlacWFYY1otMTEyTE1KVml5cHdQbUNkZTlLcmZOZy1yQ2g2MmpQQmo?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsBytes&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quo